{"id":"01a0444f-a51e-7b4a-9d46-da475d1efab7","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.4.4.1.4","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.4.4.1.4\",\"title\":\"Zephyr: link-local from IID\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:42:21.891126Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:38:52.91046Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:38:52.91046Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:43:52.91046Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-27T17:38:52.91046Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.4.4.1.4\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.4.4.1\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:42:22.74477Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Implemented alias-safe Zephyr link-local construction: lichen_make_link_local snapshots the 8-byte IID before writing fe80::/64, so IID input may alias either half of struct in6_addr. Added direct byte-exact vectors from ipv6-addresses.json shapes, verified U/L-set IIDs are copied without a second mutation, tested leading/trailing aliases, and asserted NULL IID leaves output unchanged. Validation: host C/UBSan CMake build + CTest pubkey_to_iid 1/1; Python cross-implementation address vectors 7/7; Rust ipv6_address_vectors 4/4. Native 0200::/8 behavior and short_addr_iid untouched.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-27T17:41:05.43874Z"}
